  <data name="lblItem2.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Butternut pumpkin, or butternut squash, has hard golden-brown skin with bright orange flesh on the inside. This pumpkin is versatile and delicious with a sweet, nutty taste. A perfect allrounder, you can roast, mash, fry, bake and even air-fry it. $6.00 / 1EA</value>
